-        "700 => 700MHz",
-        "600 => 600MHz"
+        "550 => 550MHz, the default (DefaultIndex 2) and the only value in use.",
+        "The GPU is kept at or below 550MHz at all times: this node has no action and its default is written once when the power HAL starts (ResetOnInit).",
