+        "Limit 1: from kernel boot until the power HAL starts the GPU is not capped.",
+        "Limit 2: the HAL writes the value once. If something else writes dvfs_max_lock later, the cap is not put back until the HAL restarts.",
+        "0 (unlocked) and 700 are used by no action. The two lines stay only because they are the context of the Paths change in patch 0002: without them 'git apply --reverse --check' of 0002 fails and scripts/prepare-tree.sh stops on its second run."
       ],
